{"availability":"available","full":"Nawafalzanbaqi/medicare-plus-demo","name":"medicare-plus-demo","description":"Portfolio demo of a bilingual medical platform built with Next.js 16, Sanity CMS, and Tailwind 4. Sanitized version of a real client project.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-17T12:54:43Z","updated":"2026-08-12T20:43:54Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://medicare-plus-demo.vercel.app","topics":["arabic","healthcare","nextjs","portfolio","rtl","sanity","tailwindcss","typescript"],"demo":"https://medicare-plus-demo.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:01.627Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:01.627Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:01.627Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T16:08:20.026Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T02:09:01.627Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A bilingual website for a 15-year-old medical complex in Riyadh — built with Next.js 16, Sanity CMS, and Tailwind 4, with an Arabic-branded admin dashboard and a WhatsApp-first booking experience.","MediCare Plus is a 15-year-old clinic in Riyadh, Saudi Arabia, with eleven specialty departments serving thousands of families. Despite its established reputation, three departments — Cosmetic, Surgery, and Audiology — were underperforming, while a newer competitor founded in 2021 began capturing demand for cosmetic services in the same neighborhood.","This is a portfolio project showcasing a real-world bilingual medical website — built end-to-end as a production-ready prototype."],"features":["🌍 Bilingual RTL/LTR — Arabic-default with full English support; direction, fonts, and layouts switch automatically per locale.","🎛️ Arabic-branded CMS — Sanity Studio customized end-to-end: Arabic title, custom dashboard, logo, theme, and bespoke document actions.","💬 WhatsApp-first booking — Every CTA opens WhatsApp with a contextual, pre-filled, bilingual message (department, service, doctor, time preference, customer details).","⚡ Sub-2s loads — Static generation, AVIF/WebP images via next/image, Lenis smooth scroll, and a budget-conscious bundle.","📱 Mobile-first — Designed for Saudi mobile traffic patterns; every breakpoint verified in both reading directions."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Nawafalzanbaqi/medicare-plus-demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"bbe176ab07ceebf45f9b6101ad90a165bea5a69d3d754db8293de25e65e3ff97","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T16:08:20.124Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:08:20.124Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A bilingual website for a 15-year-old medical complex in Riyadh — built with Next.js 16, Sanity CMS, and Tailwind 4, with an Arabic-branded admin dashboard and a WhatsApp-first booking experience.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Nawafalzanbaqi/medicare-plus-demo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"📱 Mobile-first — Designed for Saudi mobile traffic patterns; every breakpoint verified in both reading directions.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Nawafalzanbaqi/medicare-plus-demo/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"bbe176ab07ceebf45f9b6101ad90a165bea5a69d3d754db8293de25e65e3ff97","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Nawafalzanbaqi/medicare-plus-demo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:08:20.124Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-12T20:43:54Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Nawafalzanbaqi/medicare-plus-demo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:08:20.125Z","hash":"bbe176ab07ceebf45f9b6101ad90a165bea5a69d3d754db8293de25e65e3ff97","originalBytes":13743,"storedBytes":13743,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["sanity","studio","booking","public","bilingual","departments","docs","screenshots","project","api","built","cms","department","npm","vercel","arabic","blog","content","dashboard","doctor","every","ltr","next","rtl","secret","webhook","whatsapp"